# Held on disk, not in git: the AT&T DSP3210 manual and data sheet here are
# scans of 1991-93 AT&T Microelectronics publications, re-hosted on GitHub
# by a hobbyist in a repository without a licence, and they show no
# redistribution terms (this repository is public).  MANIFEST.md and
# SHA256SUMS list every file with its URL, size and SHA-256; fetch.sh
# fetches them again and checks them.
*.pdf
*.pdf.part
